---
import LegalPage from "../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { site } from "../../data/site";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy policy | ${site.name}`}
  lang="en"
  alternateHref="/de/datenschutz"
>
  <LegalPage title="Privacy policy">
    <p>
      This is a translation. The <a href="/de/datenschutz" hreflang="de"
        >German version</a
      > is legally binding.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Controller</h2>
    <address>
      {site.name}<br />
      {site.country.en}
    </address>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

    <h2>2. Hosting via GitHub Pages</h2>
    <p>
      This website is hosted on GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin
      P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. When you visit this
      site, GitHub processes technically necessary data, in particular your IP
      address, in order to deliver the site and keep the service secure. GitHub
      stores this data in server log files.
    </p>
    <p>
      The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. My legitimate interest is the secure
      and reliable provision of this website. Data may be transferred to the
      USA. GitHub is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework, which
      ensures an adequate level of data protection.
    </p>
    <p>
      For more information, see <a
        href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's privacy statement</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>3. No cookies, no tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not set cookies and does not use any analytics or
      tracking services. Fonts are loaded locally from this website, so no
      connections to third parties are made for them.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Contact by email</h2>
    <p>
      If you send me an email, I process your information solely to handle your
      request. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR if your request relates to
      a contract or pre-contractual measures, otherwise Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Your
      data is deleted as soon as it is no longer needed for this purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      This website contains links to GitHub and LinkedIn. Data is only
      transferred to these providers once you click one of these links. Their
      own privacy policies apply there.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the GDPR you have the right at any time to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>access the data stored about you (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
      <li>rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
      <li>erasure of your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
      <li>restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
      <li>data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
      <li>object to the processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
      <li>lodge a complaint with a data protection authority (Art. 77 GDPR)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To do so, simply contact me by email at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
        >{site.email}</a
      >.
    </p>

    <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>
  </LegalPage>
</Layout>
